To update fimware:
1] Copy the new image to a fat-formated floppy
2] if in SRM (>>> at console) type set os_type nt and recycle power
3] system reboot in alphabios; enter F2 during system check to enter setup
4] choose update alhabios with above floppy in dva0
5] system will reset in SRM for update and choose entire update (note update
srom twice)
6] after update recycle power and again enter update: choose CMOS option; F6
and reset bootup to VMS (SRM) console; recycle power
7] use HPQ quickstart setup disk-check islandco.com support page for futher
instructions
mhr
