It seems that you have the MX5 model of the PWS like mine.
This model version has a buggy chipset and Digital locked the
64bit PCIs so only tested cards from Digital run without an error message.

There is one way to override this protection. But be careful!
On the SRM prompt execute following command:

set pci_device_override [device-id][vendor-id]

set pci_device_override -1 will disable checking altogether but only in
the same sense that rm -rf/* will let you free up some disk space :-)

good luck trying that
Reinhard

